WEBVTT

00:14:26.002 --> 00:14:30.544
contributing to a utopian project
of a global network.

00:14:30.568 --> 00:14:33.945
And while it may seem impossible
to consider the values

00:14:33.969 --> 00:14:36.211
of users worldwide,

00:14:36.235 --> 00:14:37.917
it's worth believing

00:14:37.941 --> 00:14:41.227
that there's more that connects us
than separates us.

00:14:41.624 --> 00:14:45.331
MR: Yeah, at a time
when populism is gaining strength,

00:14:45.355 --> 00:14:48.553
it becomes popular
to justify the symptoms,

00:14:48.577 --> 00:14:49.855
to eradicate them,

00:14:49.879 --> 00:14:51.767
to make them invisible.

00:14:52.919 --> 00:14:56.268
This ideology is spreading worldwide,

00:14:56.292 --> 00:14:59.077
analog as well as digital,

00:14:59.903 --> 00:15:03.395
and it's our duty to stop it